yle="font-size:90%;"> and </span><math id="alg2.l9.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d_{down}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">w</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">n</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d_{down}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg2.l9.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> are the highest and lowest ranked documents (from the ranker’s output) respectively.
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l10.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">10:</span></span>
                
                
              <span id="alg2.l10.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  </span><span id="alg2.l10.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">end</span><span id="alg2.l10.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="alg2.l10.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">for</span>
</div>
